  "licensing": "UNRESOLVED PRODUCT DECISION, deliberately not settled here. The original carries a wall of photographs of identifiable, named employees. This build's capture pass replaces images inside team/grid/headshot/people containers with flat neutral tiles of the same box and radius, which is what cleared /about — but the /careers equivalent has NOT been re-captured and still shows empty cells where the original has photographs. Whether to reproduce roughly thirty named individuals' faces and bios is a product and privacy decision left explicitly for a human. A generator MUST default to placeholder.neutral-tile and MUST NOT fabricate or reproduce a real person's likeness, name or bio. HANDOFF.md:343-350",
